{"product_id":"heets-amber-label","title":"IQOS HEETS Amber Label","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAmber Label HEETS - A rich tobacco blend.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIQOS have created an alternative for adult smokers who would otherwise continue to smoke cigarettes and want to enjoy real tobacco taste without the smoke or ash of cigarettes. This product is not intended for non smokers or ex smokers and is compatible only with the IQOS device. Do not smoke or use with other devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eEach HEETS stick contains 0.5mg of nicotine and other flavor options are available.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41673629728823,"sku":"Heets Amber Label - Pack","price":590.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673629761591,"sku":"Heets Amber Label - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/heets-amber.jpg?v=1747872150","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/heets-amber-label","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




